@host = http://localhost:5985
@auth = Basic admin:{{$dotenv COUCHDB_PASSWORD}}

### Verificar que CouchDB responde
GET {{host}}/
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Crear base de sistema _users
PUT {{host}}/_users
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Crear base de sistema _replicator
PUT {{host}}/_replicator
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Crear la base del proyecto
PUT {{host}}/mercapos
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Crear base separada para credenciales y sesiones (no replicar)
PUT {{host}}/mercapos_auth
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Listar bases de datos
GET {{host}}/_all_dbs
Authorization: {{auth}}
